  - elementId: head-tag
    elementType: text
    bounds: [884, 62, 332, 54]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      color: "$muted"
      align: [right, top]
      lineHeight: 1.6
      fontFamily: {latin: "Consolas", ea: "MiSans"}
      text: |
        server/tune.py
        server/rag.py
        docs/training-principles.md
  - elementId: subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 154, 1100, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$body"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>RAG 与召回只负责「喂料」，模型只负责「建议」——<strong><span style="color:$orange">能不能落地，代码说了算</span></strong>。</p>

