  - elementId: s1a-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 506, 260, 110]
    content:
      style: "$stageDesc"
      text: 今日卡「超额完成 / 只跑了一部分」填实际公里数，log 接口对比计划值：>110% 记超额、<50% 记不足。
  - elementId: s1-arrow1
    elementType: line
    bounds: [324, 477, 37, 4]
    viewBox: [37, 4]
    points: "0,2 37,2"
    arrow: [null, arrow]
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "#9AA0A6"}
  # 阶段 2
  - elementId: s1b-chip
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [361, 466, 26, 26]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$orange"}
  - elementId: s1b-chip-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [361, 466, 26, 26]
    content: {fontSize: 14, bold: true, color: "#FFFFFF", align: [center, middle], wrap: false, text: "2"}
  - elementId: s1b-name
    elementType: text
    bounds: [397, 468, 224, 24]
    content:
      style: "$stageName"
      wrap: false
      text: RAG 知识检索
  - elementId: s1b-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [361, 506, 260, 110]
    content:
      style: "$stageDesc"
      text: docs/training-principles.md 切 28 块入库；中文 bigram 分词 + 标题标签权重 ×2，按口语问法召回 top-k 原则。
  - elementId: s1-arrow2
    elementType: line
    bounds: [621, 477, 37, 4]
    viewBox: [37, 4]
    points: "0,2 37,2"
    arrow: [null, arrow]
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "#9AA0A6"}
  # 阶段 3
  - elementId: s1c-chip
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [658, 466, 26, 26]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$orange"}
  - elementId: s1c-chip-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [658, 466, 26, 26]
    content: {fontSize: 14, bold: true, color: "#FFFFFF", align: [center, middle], wrap: false, text: "3"}
  - elementId: s1c-name
    elementType: text
    bounds: [694, 468, 224, 24]
    content:
      style: "$stageName"
      wrap: false
      text: 案例召回
  - elementId: s1c-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [658, 506, 260, 110]
    content:
      style: "$stageDesc"
      text: 查 ai_case 表本人历史案例，按「阶段 + 触发类型 + 偏差率 log 刻度」算相似度，取最像的几条当参考。
  - elementId: s1-arrow3
