    bounds: [118, 704, 416, 56]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      bold: true
      color: "$red"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 越界红线 · 知识库原则明令禁止
  - elementId: s1-fail-arrow
    elementType: line
    bounds: [552, 730, 40, 4]
    viewBox: [40, 4]
    points: "0,2 40,2"
    arrow: [null, arrow]
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$red"}
  - elementId: s1-fail-out
    elementType: text
    bounds: [604, 704, 612, 56]
    content:
      fontSize: 13.5
      color: "$ink"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 如「轻松跑比长距离还长」这类结构性越界，在闸门处直接拒收，与措辞无关

  # ================= 第二排 标题 =================
  - elementId: s2-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 824, 90, 66]
    content:
      fontSize: 54
      bold: true
      color: "$orange"
      wrap: false
      text: "02"
  - elementId: s2-title
    elementType: text
