    fill: {type: solid, color: "$orange"}
  - elementId: lab-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [124, 1166, 1076, 64]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      color: "$ink"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><strong>降级链：</strong>未配密钥 / 调用超时 / 校验不过 → 规则模板顶上，体验不断档；埋点 source=template，失败原因逐条可审计，指标页「AI 文案使用率」只统计真实通过的调用。</p>

  # ================= 旁支 · 重排推荐人 =================
  - elementId: side-kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 1270, 600, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      bold: true
      color: "$ink"
      letterSpacing: 2
      wrap: false
      text: 旁支 · 重排页的 AI 推荐人
  - elementId: side-flow
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 1302, 640, 92]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      text: |
        <p>天气打断计划时，规则引擎先出 main / alt 两个候选方案 → LLM 结合 RAG 原则做推荐并给出理由 → 同样过数值断言 → 只影响「推荐」卡片展示，不动课表。</p>
  - elementId: side-divider
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [730, 1302, 2, 92]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: side-assert
    elementType: text
    bounds: [758, 1302, 458, 92]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      text: |
        <p>推荐文案里的每个数字同样过 assert set(nums) &lt;= set(facts)，编数即整条降级模板——旁支和主流水线共用同一套防幻觉机制。</p>

  # ================= 埋点带 =================
  - elementId: track-band
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 1430, 1152, 64]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$ink"}
  - elementId: track-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [88, 1430, 1104, 64]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><strong>每个节点都留痕：</strong>ai_tune_deviation 记录 prompt_ver / kb_ids / case_ids / applied；rearrange_ai_recommend 记录采纳与否；ai_case 周末按执行率回填 good / bad——案例库越用越准。</p>

  # ================= 落地结果 =================
  - elementId: ft-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 1530, 1152, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: ft-label
