  - elementId: ft1-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 1586, 48, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$orange"}
  - elementId: ft1-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 1602, 368, 48]
    content: {fontSize: 38, bold: true, color: "$ink", wrap: false, text: 28 块}
  - elementId: ft1-cap
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 1654, 340, 58]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      text: 训练原则知识库：docs/training-principles.md 切块入库，中文 bigram 检索，9/9 口语问法命中。
  - elementId: ft2-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [456, 1586, 48, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$orange"}
  - elementId: ft2-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [456, 1602, 368, 48]
    content: {fontSize: 38, bold: true, color: "$ink", wrap: false, text: 2 道防线}
  - elementId: ft2-cap
    elementType: text
    bounds: [456, 1654, 340, 58]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      text: 结构红线（辅助课 ≤ 长距离 70%）+ 每周冷却幂等——拦住「轻松跑比长距离还长」这类结构性错误。
  - elementId: ft3-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [848, 1586, 48, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$orange"}
  - elementId: ft3-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [848, 1602, 368, 48]
    content: {fontSize: 38, bold: true, color: "$ink", wrap: false, text: 0 写库入口}
  - elementId: ft3-cap
    elementType: text
    bounds: [848, 1654, 340, 58]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
