  - elementId: ft-src
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 1714, 760, 16]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      color: "$muted"
      wrap: false
      fontFamily: {latin: "Consolas", ea: "MiSans"}
      text: github.com/SamuelPsq/mapaopao · 马跑跑 MAPAOPAO · 规则引擎为主，LLM 为辅
  - elementId: ft-copy
    elementType: text
    bounds: [916, 1714, 300, 16]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      color: "$muted"
      align: [right, top]
      wrap: false
      text: © 2026 马跑跑
